00:05:31,428 --> 00:05:37,428
When the last thing you expect becomes the only thing you want.

2
00:11:02,857 --> 00:11:08,857
The Idea of You is a romance, drama, comedy film directed by Michael Showalter.

3
00:16:34,285 --> 00:16:40,285
40-year-old single mom Solène begins an unexpected romance with 24-year-old Hayes
Campbell, the lead singer of August Moon, the hottest boy band on the planet.

4
00:22:05,714 --> 00:22:11,714
As they begin a whirlwind romance, it isn't long before Hayes' superstar status poses unavoidable challenges to their
relationship, and Solène soon discovers that life in the glare of his spotlight might be more than she bargained for.

5
00:27:37,142 --> 00:27:43,142
Solène, played by Anne Hathaway.

6
00:33:08,571 --> 00:33:14,571
Hayes, played by Nicholas Galitzine.

7
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:46,000
Izzy, played by Ella Rubin.

8
00:44:11,428 --> 00:44:17,428
Tracy, played by Annie Mumolo.

9
00:49:42,857 --> 00:49:48,857
Daniel, played by Reid Scott.

10
00:55:14,285 --> 00:55:20,285
Eva, played by Perry Mattfeld.

11
01:00:45,714 --> 01:00:51,714
The Idea of You is a 2024 American romantic comedy drama film directed by Michael Showalter from a
screenplay he co-wrote with Jennifer Westfeldt, based on the novel of the same name by Robinne Lee.

12
01:06:17,142 --> 01:06:23,142
Starring Anne Hathaway and Nicholas Galitzine, it chronicles the love dilemma
between a single mother and the lead singer of a popular boy band.

13
01:11:48,571 --> 01:11:54,571
A film adaptation of the novel was announced in late 2018 by the producers Cathy Schulman and Gabrielle Union; no further
development was made until in mid-2021 with the involvement of Westfeldt, Hathaway, Showalter, and Galitzine being announced.

14
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
The film was shot by cinematographer Jim Frohna predominantly
in Georgia, United States, during late 2022.

15
01:22:51,428 --> 01:22:57,428
Peter Teschner edited the film while Siddhartha
Khosla composed the original score.

16
01:28:22,857 --> 01:28:28,857
Savan Kotecha composed and wrote the original songs.

17
01:33:54,285 --> 01:34:00,285
The Idea of You premiered at South by Southwest on March 16, 2024,
and was released on Amazon Prime Video on May 2, 2024.

18
01:39:25,714 --> 01:39:31,714
The film received positive reviews from critics.

19
01:44:57,142 --> 01:45:03,142
The film explores themes of based on novel or book, age
difference, singer, forty something, single mother.

20
01:50:28,571 --> 01:50:34,571
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
